  "ruleText": "Bar 404.07 Scheduling Hearing. If the board has not received a written response within 20 days from the date the licensee signed for the notice, the proposed fine shall become final.\n\nSource. #6577, eff 9-13-97 (formerly Bar 503.04); ss by #7323, eff 7-26-00; ss by #9221, INTERIM, eff 7-30-08; ss by #9345, eff 12-10-08; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15",
